From: Nick Kennedy <local-experiment>
Subject: [PRIVATE 15/15] opt-in shader read translation for targets left in rate-map layout

DXMT_RATE_MAP_READ=1 with DXMT_RATE_MAP_POSITION=1 only. Depth/MSAA targets additionally need
DXMT_RATE_MAP_ATTACHMENT_PROBE=1. No pass selection, and no materialisation for copies,
CPU access, compute or UAV reads.

